// Seeding a cookie needs a jar to seed. A client without one would accept the call, store the
// cookie nowhere, and send it never — a silence the program could only discover by watching a
// request it thought was authenticated come back unauthorized.
// expect: error E0007 at 9:6
// expect: exit 1
use std.http.client
use std.http.server

echo client.new("https://svc.test").store_cookie(server.cookie("sid", "abc")).base_url()
